<% content_for :title, 'Delete your account' %>
<div style="background:#f7f5f0; min-height:70vh; padding:24px 16px;">
  <div style="max-width:720px; margin:0 auto; background:#fff; border:0.5px solid #FAC775; border-radius:12px; overflow:hidden;">
    <div style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FFB627,#ffca5e); padding:16px 20px;">
      <h1 style="font-size:20px; color:#412402; font-weight:700; margin:0;">Delete your Bolo Kobul account</h1>
    </div>
    <div style="padding:20px; font-size:14px; color:#444; line-height:1.7;">
      <p>You can delete your Bolo Kobul account and its data at any time, on the website or in the app.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size:16px; color:#412402; font-weight:700; margin:18px 0 8px;">How to delete your account</h2>
      <ol style="list-style:decimal; padding-left:20px; margin:0 0 12px;">
        <li>Log in to <a href="<%= root_path %>" style="color:#B97A00;">bolokobul.com</a> or the Bolo Kobul app.</li>
        <li>Open the menu and go to <strong>Privacy Settings → Account Settings</strong>.</li>
        <li>Under <strong>Delete Account</strong>, enter your password, tick the box and tap <strong>Delete my account</strong>.</li>
      </ol>
      <p>Your account is hidden from other members straight away and <strong>erased permanently after 30 days</strong>.
        To change your mind, log in within those 30 days and tap <strong>Cancel deletion</strong>.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size:16px; color:#412402; font-weight:700; margin:18px 0 8px;">What is deleted</h2>
      <ul style="list-style:disc; padding-left:20px; margin:0 0 12px;">
        <li>Your account, name, email address and phone number</li>
        <li>Your marriage profiles, with all their details, photos and documents</li>
        <li>Your chats, 1st and 2nd Kobul connections, favourites and notifications</li>
        <li>Unused butterflies (they cannot be refunded)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 style="font-size:16px; color:#412402; font-weight:700; margin:18px 0 8px;">What is kept</h2>
      <p>Records of payments you made (amount, date and order number) are kept for accounting and tax purposes,
        without your name, email address or phone number.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size:16px; color:#412402; font-weight:700; margin:18px 0 8px;">Can't log in?</h2>
      <p style="margin:0;">Email <a href="mailto:support@bolokobul.com?subject=Delete%20my%20account" style="color:#B97A00;">support@bolokobul.com</a>
        from the email address registered on your account, with the subject "Delete my account". We will delete it for you.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
